---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const appUrl = 'https://app-pipstride.homever.my.id';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mission & Engineering Philosophy — Pipstride"
  description="Why the separation of telemetry from execution is essential for disciplined traders. The engineering philosophy behind Pipstride's air-gapped architecture."
>
  <div class="site-container page-content">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="tech-pill status-live animate-pulse-glow">
        <span class="radar-dot"></span>
        <span>THE PIPSTRIDE MANIFESTO</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="page-title">
        Telemetry Must Be Separated From Execution.
      </h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        We believe serious trading infrastructure requires physical air-gapping. Here is why we built a purely passive telemetry platform.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="story-grid">
      <!-- Section 1: The Status Quo Problem -->
      <section class="tech-card story-card">
        <span class="story-coord mono">01 // THE STATUS QUO TRAP</span>
        <h2 class="story-title">The Danger of All-in-One Execution Tools</h2>
        <p class="story-text">
          Almost every commercial trading tool today seeks to control order execution. They ask for your master trading passwords, your investor credentials, or install Expert Advisors with broad <code class="mono">OrderSend()</code> and <code class="mono">PositionClose()</code> privileges.
        </p>
        <p class="story-text">
          This introduces severe, unacceptable systemic risks: rogue webhook signals, API misconfigurations, slippage during disconnects, and vulnerable cloud endpoints capable of wiping out entire accounts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: The Pipstride Philosophy -->
      <section class="tech-card story-card highlight-card">
        <span class="story-coord mono text-emerald">02 // THE PASSIVE CONDUIT</span>
        <h2 class="story-title">Physical Incapability as a Security Feature</h2>
        <p class="story-text">
          Pipstride was built on an uncompromising rule: <strong>a monitoring system should never have the power to touch your trades.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="story-text">
          Our MQL5 sensor (<code class="mono">PipstrideMonitor.mq5</code>) is strictly a one-way egress beacon. It has zero order-routing algorithms, zero trade execution APIs, and zero credential storage. Even if our backend servers are down or under maintenance, your MetaTrader 5 terminal continues operating without the slightest interruption or risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: The Three Tenets -->
      <section class="tech-card story-card">
        <span class="story-coord mono">03 // CORE TENETS</span>
        <h2 class="story-title">Our Three Non-Negotiable Guarantees</h2>
        <div class="tenets-list">
          <div class="tenet-item">
            <span class="tenet-num mono">A.</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="tenet-heading">Zero Execution Capability (ADR 0004)</h3>
              <p class="tenet-body">The codebase physically excludes all trade placement functions. Any route attempting order submission returns an unyielding HTTP 403 Forbidden.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tenet-item">
            <span class="tenet-num mono">B.</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="tenet-heading">Auditable Open-Source Sensor</h3>
              <p class="tenet-body">Our MQL5 sensor is distributed as clean, commented source code. Any trader can inspect every line in MetaEditor before compiling.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tenet-item">
            <span class="tenet-num mono">C.</span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="tenet-heading">Precision Over Hype</h3>
              <p class="tenet-body">No "AI profit predictions", no get-rich-quick claims, and no automated copy-trading schemes. Just raw, institutional-grade telemetry and discipline analytics.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Actions -->
    <div class="about-footer-cta">
      <a href="/#architecture" class="btn-secondary">
        <span>Review System Architecture</span>
      </a>
      <a href={appUrl} class="btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span>Launch Web Console [↗]</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 60px 24px 100px;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .story-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .story-card {
    padding: 32px 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .highlight-card {
    border-color: var(--border-emerald);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #13242b, #0e1920);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), var(--shadow-glow-emerald);
  }

  .story-coord {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .text-emerald {
    color: var(--g);
  }

  .story-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .story-text {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .story-text code {
    background: rgba(41, 64, 74, 0.4);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .story-text strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* Tenets */
  .tenets-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .tenet-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .tenet-num {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--g);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .tenet-heading {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .tenet-body {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-footer-cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
